@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1: severity-summary, expected 200; High, Medium, Low по 1 (порядок за критичністю, Critical відсутній)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1: summary зі status=Triaged, expected 200 [{"severity":"Medium","count":1}]
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1: summary зі status=Resolved, expected 200 []
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1: summary зі status=Unknown, expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1: summary зі status=1 (число), expected 400
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=1
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1 (знахідка 1): list зі status=1, expected 400 (до виправлення було 200)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=1
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1 (знахідка 2): невідомий API-маршрут, expected 404 problem+json (до виправлення було 200 text/html)
GET {{host}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json